This directory vendors four tagged-address test-data files from the
datamade/usaddress project:

    https://github.com/datamade/usaddress/tree/main/measure_performance/test_data

at commit aa7699b53a0843fc443f9e87285b88cbd9eaf50a:

    labeled.xml
    multi_word_state_addresses.xml
    simple_address_patterns.xml
    us50_test_tagged.xml

Two further files at that path, synthetic_osm_data.xml and
synthetic_clean_osm_data.xml, are not vendored here — see the doc comment on
UsAddressCases in ../../usaddress.go for why.

